      "line": 23,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 94,
      "quote": "有司奏：「大明故事，太子妃玄宮中有石誌。參議墓銘不出禮典。近宋元嘉中，顏延作王球石誌。素族無碑策，故以紀德。自爾以來，王公以下，咸共遵用。儲妃之重，禮殊恆列，既有哀策，謂不須石誌。」從之。",
      "kind": "court_memorial",
      "speaker": "有司",
      "memorialized_person_id": "3c9_d1d_870_B",
      "inscription_author_person_id": "ftg_rxy_day",
      "author_surface": "顏延",
      "previous_example": "大明故事，太子妃玄宮中有石誌",
      "decision": "謂不須石誌"
    },
    {
      "book": "南史/卷11",
      "revision": 2288359,
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B711&oldid=2288359",
      "raw": "source-evidence/nanshi022-wang/nan011-ws2288359.wikitext",
      "sha256": "056a4790420554786f40b92b14255aeec0a0eb168722bfeda19ad5f78f6363d4",
      "line": 108,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 78,
      "quote": "時議欲立石志，王儉曰：「石志不出禮典，起宋元嘉中顏延之為王球石志。素族無銘策，故以紀行。自爾以來，共相祖習。儲妃之重，禮絕恒例，既有哀策，不煩石志。」從之。",
      "kind": "biography_attributed_speech",
      "speaker_person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA",
      "inscription_author_person_id": "ftg_rxy_day",
      "memorialized_person_id": "3c9_d1d_870_B",
      "author_surface": "顏延之",
      "decision": "不煩石志"
    }
  ],
